centrated  effort into learning hebrew at least  enough to be able to read what's going  on before i come here  there you have it the next video that  you see  from me will be from canada and i just  wanted to stress this the sort of magic  formula for language learning is you  want to maximize your motivation and  interest  plus put as much time in as possible  those two things added up and then  divided by  any inhibitions resistance frustrations  negative feelings  that you may have towards learning  towards using the language towards the  language itself that's the formula  so think of that when you  decide on your language learning  strategy  thank you and next time we'll be from  canada bye for now  [Music]  you
 

